Xiaomi Pineapple audio source for houji

Imported from MiCode/vendor_qcom_opensource_audio-kernel, aurora-u-oss,
commit d2ddef03a379bc82c7bcd08481e29e08bbff80eb (2024-03-19).
This release includes the houji CS35L41 TDM links and speaker DSP driver.

The Lineage external-module adapter owns the build; Android.bp and Android.mk
are disabled to avoid registering a second audio UAPI provider with Soong.
The CS35L41 driver uses its vendor platform-data header explicitly. The
MiCode 6.1 remoteproc PAS driver selects the ADSP DTB firmware itself.
